                                "sense_id": "a437d491-4234-3b32-ab4a-8ce42fbee65f",
                                "text": "“But the real trick”, he said, “is to make sure you don’t over-exert yourself in the first place.” The key to post-exercise chic is simply not to sweat. Of course, it’s the first rule of style. Never, ever overdo it."
